section Block22
/-
  F1Paper/New.lean — declarations written for version 2 of the paper that are not in
  the corpus yet.  Tier [P*]: drafted, not compiled.

  1. The corrected unit structure (Theorem 17.9(b) and Remark 17.10 of the paper).
     The corpus input `UnitStructure` (PCF_sesion_M12_unificado) omits the hypothesis
     that r lies in ℚ(√5); as written it is false (r = 2 + √3 has integer trace 4 and
