/-- **[P*]** The zero set of `L(s,χ₅)` in the strip is closed under `ρ ↦ 1 − ρ` and
    under conjugation: `ZIsAVSet` for the instance that matters, from the functional
    equation and the real coefficients. -/
theorem zIsAVSet_chi5 :
    F1PCFUnified.ZIsAVSet
      (F1PCFUnified.stripZeros (DirichletCharacter.LFunction F1PCFUnified.chi5_D)) := by
